> Susanne has just informed me about the status of the joint publication.
> I=E2=80=99m gladly taking over the coordination, and at the same time nee=
d to point
> out that my capacity is limited due to finishing the PhD within half a
> year. Do you all agree to this publication being coordinated by me?
>
