>      *   3 fertilization applied and 4 the local requirements/laws
>      *   5 sowing dates and harvest dates and 6 deviation from how this i=
s
> usually handled in your country (e.g. 4 weeks earlier)
>      *   6 climate extremes that were yield relevant
>   *   A brief description of the wrangled data
>      *   7 All recorded variables / attributes
>      *   8 Anomalies (e.g. missing yield and yield quality data year 2022=
,
> in location 2)
>
