> received I=E2=80=99ll gladly set up a meeting to discuss the next steps. =
I=E2=80=99m at my
> final draft of the Lupin-Oat publication for the trials conducted in CH, =
we
> can use major elements thereof as basis to our joint publication =F0=9F=
=98=8A
>
> Do you remember who has participated in the MIC Lupin / Oat, are we
> missing someone (for now we are three countries)?
>
> Could I ask you to please respond to this email by June 11, or let me kno=
w
> if this is not possible?
>
> Thank you and best wishes
> Yannik
